      "content": "I get that, but we both know the reviewers at this symposium are going to be pretty brutal about the statistical power. Honestly, if we lead with a big \"limitations\" section, it might just give them an excuse to reject it outright. Do you think there's a way we could frame the data collection differently so it doesn't look like a weakness?",
