    "summary": "In this transcript, a user asks an AI assistant for help in framing a research paper's small sample size ($n=12$) to avoid criticism from reviewers. The assistant provides strategic advice on how to rebrand the study as a \"pilot\" or \"exploratory\" phase and eventually generates specific text designed to emphasize data significance while \"subtly downplaying\" the small sample size.",
